    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "legend_0010_select_01",
      "hash64": "4404085C47A20589",
      "text": "Eres el chico del faro",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "legend_0010_select_02",
      "hash64": "4404055C47A20070",
      "text": "No caigo...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_02a",
      "hash64": "1FBE9ABF76075683",
      "text": "¡Eso es! Veo que tienes buena memoria.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_02b",
      "hash64": "1FBE9BBF76075836",
      "text": "¡Pero bueno! Si te di la Poké Ball especial para\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)].\\c\\nNo me digas que se me olvidó presentarme...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_03",
      "hash64": "48999065A9C2D143",
      "text": "Bueno, pues me llamo Damián.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_04",
      "hash64": "48999565A9C2D9C2",
      "text": "Tú no hace falta que me digas quién eres, lo sé\\nde sobra. [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿verdad?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_05",
      "hash64": "48999665A9C2DB75",
      "text": "Has hecho buenas migas con la delegada, ¿no?\\nEres la comidilla de la academia.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_06",
      "hash64": "48999365A9C2D65C",
      "text": "Mira que no suelo pisar la academia, pero con\\ntal de conocer a[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0301)]l la famos[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa estudiante nuev[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa,\\r\\nhoy he hecho una excepción.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0301"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_07",
      "hash64": "48999465A9C2D80F",
      "text": "Necesito que me prestes tu fuerza para algo muy\\nimportante.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "legend_0010_select_03",
      "hash64": "4404065C47A20223",
      "text": "¡Claro! ¿Por qué no?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "legend_0010_select_04",
      "hash64": "44040B5C47A20AA2",
      "text": "¿De qué se trata?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_08",
      "hash64": "48999965A9C2E08E",
      "text": "¡Pero si aún no te he explicado en qué consiste!\\n¿Es que dices que sí a todo o qué?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_09",
      "hash64": "48999A65A9C2E241",
      "text": "¡Je! Veo que te pica la curiosidad. ¡Muy bien![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_10",
      "hash64": "489C9765A9C512FF",
      "text": "A lo mejor te sorprende, pero, aquí donde me\\nves, soy todo un cocinillas. Me encanta ir de\\r\\npícnic por ahí y llevar mi propia comida.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_11",
      "hash64": "489C9665A9C5114C",
      "text": "Ahora mismo estoy investigando recetas sanas\\npara hacer que los Pokémon se sientan mejor.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_12",
      "hash64": "489C9965A9C51665",
      "text": "Y, en un libro que descubrí hace no mucho,\\nencontré información la mar de interesante...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_13",
      "hash64": "489C9865A9C514B2",
      "text": "Leí que hay unos condimentos capaces de curar\\ntodos los males: las especias ocultas.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_14",
      "hash64": "489C9365A9C50C33",
      "text": "Existen cinco en total. Si se pulverizan, basta con\\nuna pizca para beneficiarse de su alto contenido\\r\\nnutritivo y mejorar el flujo sanguíneo.\\c\\n¡Incluso retrasan el proceso de envejecimiento\\ny refuerzan el sistema inmunitario![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 229,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_15",
      "hash64": "489C9265A9C50A80",
      "text": "También dice que solo se pueden encontrar en\\nPaldea y que son una auténtica rareza.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_16",
      "hash64": "489C9565A9C50F99",
      "text": "Lo malo es que están custodiadas por unos\\nPokémon llamados \"dominantes\", por lo que\\r\\nhacerse con ellas será todo un reto.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_24",
      "hash64": "4892A165A9BCCF78",
      "text": "Esos dominantes... ¿puede que sean como este?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_17",
      "hash64": "489C9465A9C50DE6",
      "text": "Si pudiese, iría yo solo, pero los combates\\nPokémon se me dan fatal.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_18",
      "hash64": "489C9F65A9C52097",
      "text": "Tampoco tengo amigos con Pokémon fuertes y,\\nsinceramente, preferiría no recurrir a la delegada.\\c\\nEs un poco... pesada.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_19",
      "hash64": "489C9E65A9C51EE4",
      "text": "¡Ahí es donde entras tú! ¡Necesito que me eches\\nuna mano![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_20",
      "hash64": "4892A565A9BCD644",
      "text": "¡Espera, espera! No hace falta que me respondas\\nahora mismo.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_23",
      "hash64": "4892A865A9BCDB5D",
      "text": "Por ahora te voy a marcar en el mapa los lugares\\ndonde parece que se encuentran los dominantes.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_21",
      "hash64": "4892A665A9BCD7F7",
      "text": "Aún hay más detalles que tengo que contarte,\\npero eso será la próxima vez que nos veamos.\\c\\nMientras tanto... toma esto como gesto de\\nbuena fe.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "legend_0010_friend_22",
      "hash64": "4892A765A9BCD9AA",
      "text": "¡Consúltalo con la almohada![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
